sequenceDiagram
    participant VolApp as Volunteer Mobile App
    participant IncMgmt as Incident Management Context
    participant CtxIntel as Context Intelligence Context
    participant DecIntel as Decision Intelligence Context
    participant RecEng as Recommendation Engine Context
    participant Notif as Notification Context

    VolApp->>IncMgmt: Ingest Observation Report (Collapsed Spectator)
    IncMgmt->>CtxIntel: Publish State Change Event (evt_incident_detected)
    CtxIntel->>DecIntel: Dispatch Context Snapshot Command
    DecIntel->>RecEng: Push Validated Risk/Decision
    RecEng->>Notif: Dispatch Alert Command (evt_recommendation_released)
    Notif->>VolApp: Push notifications to Supervisor/Steward
